{"problem":{"stackLimit":128,"modifiedUser":"FrankieFly","judgeCaseMode":"default","auth":1,"description":"农夫约翰有一片 $N∗M$ 的矩形土地。\n\n最近，由于降雨的原因，部分土地被水淹没了。\n\n现在用一个字符矩阵来表示他的土地。\n\n每个单元格内，如果包含雨水，则用”$W$”表示，如果不含雨水，则用”$.$”表示。\n\n现在，约翰想知道他的土地中形成了多少片池塘。\n\n每组相连的积水单元格集合可以看作是一片池塘。\n\n每个单元格视为与其上、下、左、右、左上、右上、左下、右下八个邻近单元格相连。\n\n请你输出共有多少片池塘，即矩阵中共有多少片相连的”$W$”块。","source":"","title":"池塘计数","type":0,"output":"输出一个整数，表示池塘数目。","ioScore":25,"codeShare":true,"isFileIO":false,"isRemote":false,"timeLimit":1000,"difficulty":0,"input":"第一行包含两个整数 $N$ 和 $M$。$1≤N,M≤1000$\n\n接下来 $N$ 行，每行包含 $M$ 个字符，字符为”$W$”或”.”，用以表示矩形土地的积水状况，字符之间没有空格。","examples":"<input>10 12\nW........WW.\n.WWW.....WWW\n....WW...WW.\n.........WW.\n.........W..\n..W......W..\n.W.W.....WW.\nW.W.W.....W.\n.W.W......W.\n..W.......W.</input><output>3</output>","hint":"","isRemoveEndBlank":true,"openCaseResult":true,"memoryLimit":256,"problemId":"Q0029","isGroup":false,"isUploadCase":true,"judgeMode":"default"},"languages":["C","C++","Java","Python3"],"samples":[{"output":"Q00291.out","input":"Q00291.in","score":1},{"output":"Q00292.out","input":"Q00292.in","score":1},{"output":"Q00293.out","input":"Q00293.in","score":1},{"output":"Q00294.out","input":"Q00294.in","score":1},{"output":"Q00295.out","input":"Q00295.in","score":1},{"output":"Q00296.out","input":"Q00296.in","score":1},{"output":"Q00297.out","input":"Q00297.in","score":1},{"output":"Q00298.out","input":"Q00298.in","score":1},{"output":"Q00299.out","input":"Q00299.in","score":1},{"output":"Q002910.out","input":"Q002910.in","score":1},{"output":"Q002911.out","input":"Q002911.in","score":1},{"output":"Q002912.out","input":"Q002912.in","score":1},{"output":"Q002913.out","input":"Q002913.in","score":1},{"output":"Q002914.out","input":"Q002914.in","score":1},{"output":"Q002915.out","input":"Q002915.in","score":1},{"output":"Q002916.out","input":"Q002916.in","score":1},{"output":"Q002917.out","input":"Q002917.in","score":1},{"output":"Q002918.out","input":"Q002918.in","score":1},